# Where Options > QUIT takes the Xbox 360 (.xex build).
#
# Copy this file to exit.txt beside meguarace.xex and change the line below.
# The first line that isn't blank or a comment counts:
#
#   default                           the console's default dashboard
#   Usb:\Aurora\default.xex           a .xex on the first USB drive (Usb0: too)
#   Usb1:\FreeStyle\default.xex       the second USB drive (Usb2: the third)
#   Hdd:\Aurora\default.xex           the hard drive's content partition
#   \Device\Mass0\Aurora\default.xex  a kernel path, used as it is
#
# '/' works as '\'. If the file isn't there, the game logs it (meguarace.log)
# and goes to the default dashboard. No exit.txt: the default dashboard.

default
